21:30:16 [6d8a] Developmental hierarchy:
21:30:16 [6d8a] 1. Labeling visible objects or people
21:30:16 [6d8a] 2. Describing visible actions
21:30:16 [6d8a] 3. Describing location
21:30:16 [6d8a] 4. Simple function or purpose, only if familiar and visually supported
21:30:16 [6d8a] 5. One supported inference or feeling question, only if appropriate
21:30:16 [6d8a] 
21:30:16 [6d8a] Question selection rules:
21:30:16 [6d8a] - At least 3 questions must be directly answerable from the picture.
21:30:16 [6d8a] - At most 1 question may ask about feeling.
21:30:16 [6d8a] - At most 1 question may ask about what might happen next.
21:30:16 [6d8a] - Avoid asking what happened before unless there is a very clear routine cue.
21:30:16 [6d8a] - Avoid "why" unless the reason is simple, familiar, and visually supported.
21:30:16 [6d8a] - Personal-experience questions are allowed only as optional extension questions, not as the main 5 questions.
21:30:16 [6d8a] 
21:30:16 [6d8a] WH-type rules:
21:30:16 [6d8a] - `wh_type` must match the actual question word.
21:30:16 [6d8a] - Allowed values: "what", "who", "where", "how", "why".
21:30:16 [6d8a] - Do not label a "How do you think..." question as `why`.
21:30:16 [6d8a] 
21:30:16 [6d8a] For EACH question, include:
21:30:16 [6d8a] 1. `question_kind`: one of ["labeling", "action", "location", "function", "supported_inference", "feeling", "personal_extension"]
21:30:16 [6d8a] 2. `wh_type`: the WH word used in the question
21:30:16 [6d8a] 3. `question`: a simple question for the child
21:30:16 [6d8a] 4. `sample_answers`: 2-4 acceptable child responses
21:30:16 [6d8a] 5. `sentence_frame`: a short sentence starter the therapist can provide
21:30:16 [6d8a] 6. `support_level`: one of ["independent", "sentence_frame", "choice_support", "modeling"]
21:30:16 [6d8a] 7. `verbal_choices`: optional 2-3 choices if the child needs support
21:30:16 [6d8a] 8. `evidence_hint`: where the child should look or what they should think about
21:30:16 [6d8a] 
21:30:16 [6d8a] Return ONLY valid JSON in this exact format:
21:30:16 [6d8a] 
